"""`api/agent/lessons.py`. `report_outcome` is a plain insert, tested against the row it leaves;
`retry_unsettled` is where every core-memory call happens, so `lessons._call` is monkeypatched
throughout -- core-memory's own tool behaviour is out of scope, the same boundary
`test_agent_jobs_api.py` draws around a real CLI versus this slice's own machinery.
"""

